{"version":1,"key":"card:138","content":{"id":138,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"206b160c-c101-42e0-af82-f1dede0f0b56","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"keyof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以查询类型包含的所有的键"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"73e56ae0-317d-4051-b861-b104bbebc61d","collabId":"96674f31-a39f-48c4-bf7f-ec1914347618","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"interface Obj {\n  a: string;\n  b: number;\n  1: string;\n  [key: string]: any;\n}\ntype Keys = keyof Obj;"},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e7cf91d9-6d45-4275-893b-bb0dfbffea45.webp","uuid":"42b8ece0-1b53-48f1-bb3c-36e3af58ecff","collabId":"7c2909f2-c93c-4a49-b910-6b008174d35b","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e7cf91d9-6d45-4275-893b-bb0dfbffea45.webp","naturalWidth":1621,"naturalHeight":1028,"width":731.4285714285714,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"593cc1fd-d5c7-4a1b-bb82-2e7e49418de7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"配合 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"keyof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和索引查询可以知道所有值的类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"3e5167a1-ce78-4db9-97b3-17bbac29c3c8","collabId":"777d720b-16b9-40cc-ac60-f693290daefa","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"type Values = Obj[Keys];"},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_51ed2193-d218-4469-9378-a00dbb0eb343.webp","uuid":"ff8310b6-80ed-445e-b0fd-44db324f8fed","collabId":"74577483-e9d1-41b1-aebe-a9f4fa131be4","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_51ed2193-d218-4469-9378-a00dbb0eb343.webp","naturalWidth":1655,"naturalHeight":1098,"width":731.4285714285714,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"99113068-ea07-461f-a71f-0c3699045f9f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"keyof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 除了可以作用于接口，还可以作用于基本数据类型，作用于基本数据类型相当于作用域其包装类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"042753a1-7c54-4df1-b3fe-9cdc0d91f10a","collabId":"5eb613be-5e02-4359-aac1-9370bd2d30ba","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"type KeyOfNumber = keyof number; // 相当于 keyof Number"},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.43cv2vdjs4m0.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.43cv2vdjs4m0.png","collabId":"d75395e0-b497-4271-9581-3f80425e564e","naturalWidth":1806,"naturalHeight":607,"width":731.4285714285714,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"32a52f56-069b-41cd-b2f3-0ba651ec30a0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"bigint"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 没有包装类型，因此 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"keyof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 作用的结构是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"never"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"01b8e09f-b301-4ea6-b0de-021b067e887e","collabId":"539cc6e4-d65a-45f3-bc6a-a366a2a626b1","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"type KeyOfUndefined = keyof undefined; // never\ntype KeyOfNull = keyof null; // never\ntype KeyOfBigint = keyof bigint; // never"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e44fc50f-9ed8-4b0f-93e2-42e92e9d7cf5","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"any"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型表示的任意类型，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"keyof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 作用的结果是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"string | number | symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"keyof unknown"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的结果是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"never"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，令我震惊的是，"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"code":true,"text":"keyof never"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":" 的结果竟然不是 "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"code":true,"text":"never"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"，而是 "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"code":true,"text":"string | number | symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":"！"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.26kaoiim16qo.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.26kaoiim16qo.png","collabId":"f768bc59-a24d-497c-8929-224d61758f39","naturalWidth":1816,"naturalHeight":504,"width":731.4285714285714,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/类型操作"],"createTime":1689568075436,"updateTime":1791903513463,"linkedCards":[{"id":4,"target":{"key":"card:4","type":"card","id":4},"summary":"通过索引我们可以查询键对应的值的类型，这个索引查询不是作用在 JavaScript 对象上，可以作用在类型上，比如接口 interface Obj { a: string; b: number; 1: string; } type A = ...","tags":["TypeScript/索引查询"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791903513463}}